   "lines": [
    "Jack and I went",
    "out sailing; the",
    "breeze was almost",
    "a reefer, but we",
    "kept all our",
    "canvass up, and",
    "had a glorious",
    "time.",
    "Oyster Bay is the",
    "perfection of a",
    "place for fellows;",
    "I often wonder if",
    "any one[?] could",
    "have a happier",
    "time than I am",
    "having.",
    "Six months ago - it",
    "seems so much longer."
   ],
